The original logo of PARI/GP, Logo_PARI-GP_Couleurs.svg, was drawn in 2012
by Sylvain Glaviano from Bordeaux University, cellule Infographie et
Multimédia, using the Liberation Sans Bold font.

The modifications to obtain Logo_PariDroid.svg were made by Andreas Enge
in 2015 by adding the text "Droid" in the Droid Sans font.

